# IMPORTANT: keep this at a single worker.
# Live dashboard updates use an in-memory WebSocket manager (app/ws_manager.py),
# which only broadcasts to connections held by the SAME process. Running multiple
# workers means a check-in handled by one worker never reaches a dashboard
# connected to another worker — the "Live" badge shows connected but events
# silently never arrive, forcing a manual refresh. Do NOT raise this above 1
# unless you also move broadcasts to a shared broker (e.g. Redis pub/sub).
web: uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT --workers 1
